Z||000024||1FST2M6||07-11-2001||01:49 PM||||we've got quite a few turbo and S/C cars also running a nitrous shot.. most shut off at 4000rpm once the turbo has spooled... but 2.0Joe has a full fogger system on his 11second AWD 16g Turbo Talon. stock internals and head.. 80+K miles. and iut's a daily driver with A/C!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>my friends S/C and nitrous Focus... it's only got 600 miles on it...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/hocusspray.jpg"> <P> ||||reg||1
